    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>The first gnolls were hyenas that gorged on flesh tainted by the Abyss. Their corruption and savagery pleased the demon lord Yeenoghu, who multiplied them and scattered them across the multiverse. Ever since, gnolls have been Yeenoghu’s cackling servants, living to bring ruin and to feast on whatever is left.</p><p>Crueler and stronger than other gnolls, pack lords bully weaker gnolls into serving them. These brutes goad their followers into terrible violence, then take the best of the plunder for themselves.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
